  "newGroupNames": [
    "four new-task parent/type results match exact released Note.new and newTodo helpers over a declared field adapter",
    "two desktop New to-do command argument results match candidate body/type requests without executing original persistence",
    "New to-do real HTTP cold restarts retain first-save state, later history and exact supported JEX metadata",
    "New to-do actual HTTP400 flag failures do not mutate existing notes and queue remains usable",
    "New to-do creation preserves every prior imported JEX record and binary through restart and export",
    "New to-do first save commits its note, notebook and initial open state in one state write",
    "New to-do rejects ambiguous creation flags and existing-note flags without any state mutation",
    "New to-do failed state persistence leaves no partial note or notebook and permits explicit retry",
    "New to-do snapshots caller fields before waiting for the serialized state queue",
    "New to-do ordinary edits and saved-version restore preserve its initial task state",
    "New to-do JEX preserves its supported task fields, parent and tags while excluding local history",
    "New to-do starts an unsaved typed draft and creates an open task only on explicit Save",
    "New to-do honours discard cancellation and New note resets an accepted task draft type",
    "New to-do real committed held save blocks duplicates and retains a newer body at the returned revision",
    "New note owns the editor after an older New to-do creation response was held after commit",
    "disposing a New to-do view after committed save suppresses every late publication and request",
    "failed New to-do persistence retains draft type and fields then supports one explicit retry",
    "a held rejected New to-do write cannot publish its failure over a newer draft owner",
    "committed New to-do save reports refresh failure separately and preserves a newer draft across a held rejected list reply"
  ],
